# Dashboard

- Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind.
- Desktop-first, operational, no generic AI-SaaS ornament.
- Read live API state. Do not hardcode fake KPIs.
- Label `simulation = true` records as simulation.
- Paginate lists. Do not load lifetime analytics in one request.
- Human Actions and Bootstrap Center must distinguish machine work from owner-only work.
- Never ask for passwords or raw tokens in the UI. OAuth redirects only.
